{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_brokeractor_base_class", "label": "BrokerActor base class (page)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_brokeractor", "label": "BrokerActor abstract base", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Owns the shared lifecycle so every protocol actor implements only three protocol hooks plus its settings glue."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_connectimplementation", "label": "connectImplementation hook", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_disconnectimplementation", "label": "disconnectImplementation hook", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Called on stop and before every re-connect attempt, so it is an idempotent contract: it may run on an already-dead connection and must drop only the live handles, never the desired subscriptions."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_dispatchoutgoing", "label": "dispatchOutgoing hook", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_lifecycle_state_machine", "label": "Connection lifecycle state machine", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reconnect runs on the system scheduler detached from the mailbox, so an in-flight attempt cannot be cancelled; the base re-checks liveness leaving the handshake, because without it a completed handshake installed live handles on a terminated actor and a failed one re-armed the backoff forever, since maxAttempts defaults to Infinity (#708)."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_outbound_buffer", "label": "Outbound buffer", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Overflow always evicts the oldest envelope (FIFO) and publishes BrokerBufferOverflow rather than throwing; outboundBuffer: 0 disables buffering and publishes BrokerNotConnected instead."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_subscriber_tracking", "label": "Subscriber tracking and topic fan-out", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "subscribeRef registers and death-watches a local ref; unsubscribeRef matches on the ref path rather than the ref object, so a different ref for the same actor still unsubscribes."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_terminated_arm", "label": "The Terminated match arm is not optional", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "onReceive is abstract so the base never sees a message and cannot act on the watch for you. Without the arm a stopped subscriber stays in every topic and costs a dead-lettered tell per fan-out (#1111), and .exhaustive() throws, which the default supervisor answers with a full broker reconnect per subscriber death. Widening the match input to MyCommand | Terminated makes the omission a build failure instead."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_remote_subscriber_watch_gap", "label": "The watch only fires for a local subscriber", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "context.watch installs a watcher only for a LocalActorRef and is a silent no-op otherwise, so a remote subscriber never produces a Terminated and keeps costing a cross-node tell on each fan-out (#918)."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_desired_subscriptions", "label": "Desired subscriptions", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Kept separate from the live handles so a runtime subscription survives a reconnect and one arriving while disconnected is applied on the next connect; seeding from options is once-only so a runtime unsubscribe is not resurrected. The replay is driven by the subclass because the right point in the handshake is protocol-specific."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_reconnect_with_backoff", "label": "Reconnect with backoff and jitter", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Without jitter the delay is a pure function of the attempt counter, so every actor that lost the same broker wakes in the same millisecond, wave after wave, and the herd holds the recovering broker down. The circuit breaker gets the same spread, one-sided, because a breaker is never re-tried early."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_lifecycle_events", "label": "Broker lifecycle events on the event stream", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "BrokerConnected, BrokerDisconnected, BrokerReconnectAttempt, BrokerReconnectFailed, BrokerBufferOverflow and BrokerNotConnected, each carrying actorPath."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_settings_resolution", "label": "Three-layer settings resolution", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Constructor argument beats HOCON beats builtInDefaultOptions; preStart merges, validates against requiredOptions and throws early so the actor takes the supervisor failure path before it ever connects."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_brokeractor_base_class", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_brokeractor", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_brokeractor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_connectimplementation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_brokeractor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_disconnectimplementation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_brokeractor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_dispatchoutgoing", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_brokeractor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_lifecycle_state_machine", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_brokeractor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_outbound_buffer", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_brokeractor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_subscriber_tracking", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_brokeractor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_desired_subscriptions", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_brokeractor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_reconnect_with_backoff", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "sou